WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.708 --> 00:00:07.437
Every key term and thinker in the course lives here, with real definitions and real citations.

2
00:00:07.437 --> 00:00:18.439
Search or browse by week. Type any concept into the search box, or use the week menu to see a week's terms together. Each entry carries the citation it comes from.

3
00:00:18.439 --> 00:00:27.154
Use terms to speak precisely. Map Exchange posts and written work read stronger when the course vocabulary is used accurately.

4
00:00:27.154 --> 00:00:34.382
Follow a term back to its week. Each entry names its home week, so you can revisit the fuller context.

5
00:00:34.382 --> 00:00:36.984
Nothing here is graded.

6
00:00:36.984 --> 00:00:41.551
Where next: Turn terms into memory with Concept Flashcards.
